    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "由探究4可以得到以下基本事实，用它可以判定两个三角形全等："
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        169,
        352,
        830,
        373
      ],
      "reading_order": 4,
      "original_image_bbox": [
        367,
        1080,
        1804,
        1145
      ],
      "model_image_bbox": [
        191,
        563,
        939,
        596
      ],
      "pdf_page_bbox": [
        88.14,
        259.41,
        432.89,
        274.88
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "三边分别相等的两个三角形全等（可以简写成“边边边”或“SSS”)."
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        169,
        381,
        867,
        401
      ],
      "reading_order": 5,
      "original_image_bbox": [
        367,
        1170,
        1884,
        1231
      ],
      "model_image_bbox": [
        191,
        609,
        981,
        641
      ],
      "pdf_page_bbox": [
        88.14,
        280.78,
        452.19,
        295.52
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "利用这个基本事实，可以说明我们曾经做过的实验的结果：将三根木条钉成一个三角形木架，这个三角形木架的形状、大小就不变了，也就是三角形具有稳定性."
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        122,
        409,
        916,
        487
      ],
      "reading_order": 6,
      "original_image_bbox": [
        265,
        1256,
        1991,
        1495
      ],
      "model_image_bbox": [
        138,
        654,
        1036,
        779
      ],
      "pdf_page_bbox": [
        63.63,
        301.41,
        477.74,
        358.9
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "上述分析过程也告诉我们：已知三角形的三边，可以利用直尺和圆规作一个三角形."
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        122,
        494,
        916,
        543
      ],
      "reading_order": 7,
      "original_image_bbox": [
        265,
        1517,
        1991,
        1667
      ],
      "model_image_bbox": [
        138,
        790,
